Pray can get you out of many jams.  Try it when you're in trouble.

To sell an item, drop it on a square other than the one in front of the
door.  Shopkeepers only buy items that their store can sell.

Rings and sinks: It gives you a clue to what kind of ring it is/was.

Banks: Dig.  Ever see strange writing on ground?  Search there.

